  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{舐|な}める (to lick X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates ongoing action. {舐|な}めている = 'is licking.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{舐|な}める (to lick X)\n- ⟦{飴|あめ}→飴：00687_ame⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{舐|な}める (to suck on candy)\n- ⟦{傷|きず}→傷：02201_kizu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{舐|な}める (to lick a wound)\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{舐|な}める (to look down on someone)\n\nCOLLOQUIAL USAGE (Sense 2):\n- {舐|な}めるな！ (Don't underestimate me!)\n- {舐|な}めてる (underestimating, not taking seriously)\n- {舐|な}められている (being looked down on)\n\nNOTE: The 'underestimate' meaning is very colloquial and often used in confrontational contexts.",
